        "value": "少參事　五員　同四員"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "少参事　五員（同四員）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Rank heading 少參事 (junior councillor) with its member count: five members (五員), followed by a subsidiary count 同四員 ('ditto, four members'). The five appointees named in the lower band to the right and left (都築平六郎, 行方百太郎, 糟谷寸斗平, 池田艮三, 武久權十郎) make up the 五員."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "少参事（小濱）"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
